         <div class="eli-subdivision" id="art_2">
            <p id="d1e239-19-1" class="oj-ti-art">Article 2</p>
            <p class="oj-normal">This Regulation shall enter into force on 1 January 2018.</p>
         </div>
      </div>
      <div class="eli-subdivision" id="fnp_1">
         <div class="oj-final">
            <p class="oj-normal">This Regulation shall be binding in its entirety and directly applicable in all Member States.</p>
            <p class="oj-normal">Done at Brussels, 18 December 2017.</p>
